{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach out to {{BUSINESS_NAME}} for an integrative consultation and whole-person review.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#fbfbf8; --card:#ffffff; --muted:#6c6c6c; --accent:#2b7a78; --accent-2:#ffb703; --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      --radius:14px; --maxw:1000px; font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;}
    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, var(--bg) 100%);color:#0b0b0b;display:flex;justify-content:center;padding:36px 18px;}
    .site{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);} 
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:18px 12px 24px;border-radius:12px 12px 6px 6px;background:var(--card);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(20,20,20,0.06)}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#115e59);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:18px}
    .brand h1{margin:0;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:-0.2px}
    .brand p{margin:0;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
    nav{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px}
    nav a.primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#0e6a67);color:#fff}

    .layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:20px;margin-top:20px}
    .panel{background:var(--card);padding:20px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(10,10,10,0.04)}

    h2{margin:0 0 10px 0}
    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px 0}

    /* inventory */
    .inventory-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px}
    .domain{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(16,16,16,0.04)}
    .domain input[type=checkbox]{width:18px;height:18px}
    .controls{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-top:12px}
    .btn{padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:0;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;cursor:pointer}
    .btn.ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(16,16,16,0.06);color:var(--muted)}

    /* agenda output */
    .agenda{margin-top:16px;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(43,122,120,0.04), rgba(43,122,120,0.02));}
    .agenda h3{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:15px}
    .agenda ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* contact form */
    form .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);display:block;margin-bottom:6px}
    input[type=text], input[type=email], textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(10,10,10,0.06)}
    textarea{min-height:120px}
    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}

    /* right column extras */
    .card-quiet{padding:16px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--glass),#f8fff8);border-radius:12px}
    .try{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}

    /* modal */
    .overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(6,6,6,0.5);display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:60}
    .modal{width:520px;max-width:94%;background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(10,10,10,0.3)}
    .modal h3{margin:0 0 6px 0}
    .modal .content{margin-top:12px}
    .breath-circle{width:120px;height:120px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--accent-2),#ffd4a3);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:10px auto}
    .breath-count{font-weight:700}
    .controls-row{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px}
    .close{background:transparent;border:0;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}

    footer{margin-top:18px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    @media (max-width:880px){
      .layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      header{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="site">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">HM</div>
        <div>
          <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>
          <p>{{TAGLINE}}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Primary Navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Start</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="conditions.html">Symptoms</a>
        <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Invest</a>
        <a href="about.html">Team</a>
        <a href="book.html">Book</a>
        <a href="contact.html" class="primary">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="layout">
      <section class="panel">
        <h2>Connect & Start a whole-person review</h2>
        <p class="lead">Use the quick inventory below to shape an initial consultation agenda and suggested follow-up cadence. This is educational and helps your clinician prepare; it is not a diagnosis.</p>

        <div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
            <strong>Whole-person inventory</strong>
            <small style="color:var(--muted)">Check the areas you'd like addressed in a first visit</small>
          </div>

          <form id="inventoryForm" onsubmit="return false;" style="margin-top:12px">
            <div class="inventory-grid" id="inventoryGrid">
              <!-- JS will populate domains -->
            </div>

            <div class="controls">
              <button class="btn" id="generateBtn">Create consultation agenda</button>
              <button class="btn ghost" id="clearBtn" type="button">Clear</button>
              <button class="btn" id="tryNowBtn" type="button">Try breathing/journaling</button>
            </div>

            <div class="agenda" id="agendaArea" hidden>
              <h3>Suggested consultation agenda</h3>
              <ul id="agendaList"></ul>
              <div style="margin-top:10px"><strong>Suggested follow-up cadence:</strong> <span id="cadenceText"></span></div>
            </div>

          </form>
        </div>

        <hr style="margin:18px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,10,0.04)">

        <h3>Contact form</h3>
        <p class="lead">Tell us a bit about what brings you here and your preferred timing for an appointment.</p>

        <form id="contactForm" action="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" method="post">
          <div class="row">
            <div>
              <label for="name">Full name</label>
              <input type="text" id="name" name="name" placeholder="Your name">
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="email">Email</label>
              <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="{{EMAIL}}">
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
            <div style="flex:1">
              <label for="phone">Phone</label>
              <input type="text" id="phone" name="phone" placeholder="{{PHONE}}">
            </div>
            <div style="width:180px">
              <label for="location">Location</label>
              <input type="text" id="location" name="location" placeholder="{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}">
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:8px">
            <label for="message">Notes for clinician</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Briefly describe current concerns and what you hope to gain."></textarea>
          </div>

          <div class="meta">By submitting you agree to receive follow up from {{BUSINESS_NAME}}. This site provides educational information and does not replace medical advice.</div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
            <button class="btn" type="submit">Request consult</button>
            <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" class="btn ghost" style="text-decoration:none">Schedule now</a>
          </div>
        </form>

      </section>

      <aside>
        <div class="panel card-quiet">
          <h3>Try a guided exercise</h3>
          <p class="lead">Short practices to calm the nervous system or focus your clarity before a consult. No sign-in required.</p>
          <div class="try">
            <button class="btn" id="openBreath">Breathing exercise</button>
            <button class="btn ghost" id="openJournal">Timed journaling</button>
            <button class="btn" id="openIntent">Set an intention</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="height:14px"></div>

        <div class="panel">
          <h4>Quick contact</h4>
          <p class="lead">Prefer a short call? Call or email to ask about availability.</p>
          <div style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)">
            <div><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
            <div><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <small>&copy; <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — A collaborative, educational approach to integrative care.</small>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <!-- Modal overlay -->
  <div class="overlay" id="overlay" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal" role="document" aria-live="polite">
      <button class="close" id="closeModal" aria-label="Close">✕</button>
      <div id="modalBody" class="content">
        <!-- content injected by JS -->
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Basic helpers
    const domains = [
      {key:'sleep',label:'Sleep & rest'},
      {key:'nutrition',label:'Nutrition & digestion'},
      {key:'movement',label:'Activity & mobility'},
      {key:'stress',label:'Stress & emotion'},
      {key:'relationships',label:'Relationships & support'},
      {key:'work',label:'Work-life & meaning'},
      {key:'environment',label:'Home & environment'},
      {key:'symptoms',label:'Physical symptoms'},
      {key:'mindset',label:'Cognitive patterns & focus'},
      {key:'spirit',label:'Spirituality & values'}
    ];

    // Populate inventory UI
    const grid = document.getElementById('inventoryGrid');
    domains.forEach(d => {
      const div = document.createElement('div'); div.className='domain';
      div.innerHTML = `<input type="checkbox" id="dom_${d.key}" name="domains" value="${d.key}"> <label for="dom_${d.key}">${d.label}</label>`;
      grid.appendChild(div);
    });

    // Mapping suggestions for agenda per domain
    const suggestions = {
      sleep:['Review sleep timing and hygiene','Consider brief sleep diary','Discuss circadian supports and daytime routines'],
      nutrition:['Food patterns review','Consider basic labs for digestion','Plan stepwise changes to meals or timing'],
      movement:['Assess movement goals and barriers','Identify gentle, daily movement prescription','Discuss strength and mobility priorities'],
      stress:['Explore stress triggers','Introduce brief regulation practices','Design a layered stress plan (immediate, daily, weekly)'],
      relationships:['Map support networks','Identify communication priorities','Propose relational goals for 4–8 weeks'],
      work:['Work rhythm review','Boundaries and pacing strategies','Tactical adjustments for energy management'],
      environment:['Assess sleep & work environments','Identify low-cost changes','Plan sensory / air quality adjustments'],
      symptoms:['Targeted symptom review','Symptom tracking plan','Prioritize red flags and safety checks'],
      mindset:['Cognitive habits mapping','Introduce simple CBT-style prompts','Design short mental skills practice'],
      spirit:['Values clarification','Short reflective practices','Align small weekly rites of meaning']
    };

    // Generate agenda
    const generateBtn = document.getElementById('generateBtn');
    const clearBtn = document.getElementById('clearBtn');
    const agendaArea = document.getElementById('agendaArea');
    const agendaList = document.getElementById('agendaList');
    const cadenceText = document.getElementById('cadenceText');

    function buildAgenda(){
      const checked = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('input[name=domains]:checked')).map(i=>i.value);
      agendaList.innerHTML='';
      if(!checked.length){
        agendaArea.hidden=true;return;
      }
      // Compose agenda: for each checked domain, pick top suggestion
      const items = [];
      checked.forEach(k=>{
        const arr = suggestions[k] || ['Discuss this area'];
        items.push({domain:k, text:arr[0]});
      });
      // If many items, group into prioritized topics
      // Show up to 6 items in initial agenda, suggest broader review topics
      const limited = items.slice(0,6);
      limited.forEach(it=>{
        const li = document.createElement('li');
        li.textContent = it.text;
        agendaList.appendChild(li);
      });

      // Add a closing item
      const closing = document.createElement('li'); closing.textContent = 'Discuss next steps, labs if indicated, and an initial monitoring plan';
      agendaList.appendChild(closing);

      // cadence heuristic
      let cadence='Follow-up cadence: ';
      if(checked.length<=2) cadence+='Single focused visit, optional check-in in 3–4 weeks.';
      else if(checked.length<=5) cadence+='Initial visit with a 2-week check-in and a fuller follow-up at 6 weeks.';
      else cadence+='Series-based plan: weekly connections for the first 4 weeks, then biweekly as progress stabilizes.';
      cadenceText.textContent = cadence;
      agendaArea.hidden=false;

      // Friendly note about scope
      const note = document.createElement('p'); note.style.color='var(--muted)'; note.style.marginTop='8px'; note.style.fontSize='13px';
      note.textContent = 'This agenda is a starting point to guide discussion. It does not replace medical assessment.';
      agendaArea.appendChild(note);
    }

    generateBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      buildAgenda();
      // Smooth scroll into view
      agendaArea.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});
    });
    clearBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      document.querySelectorAll('input[name=domains]').forEach(i=>i.checked=false);
      agendaArea.hidden=true;
    });

    // Contact form simple hook (educational; not sending here)
    document.getElementById('contactForm').addEventListener('submit', (e)=>{
      e.preventDefault();
      alert('Thank you — a team member at {{BUSINESS_NAME}} will follow up at the contact details provided.');
      e.target.reset();
    });

    // Modal and try-it features
    const overlay = document.getElementById('overlay');
    const modalBody = document.getElementById('modalBody');
    const closeModal = document.getElementById('closeModal');
    const tryNowBtn = document.getElementById('tryNowBtn');

    function openModal(contentHtml){
      modalBody.innerHTML = contentHtml;
      overlay.style.display='flex';
      overlay.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false');
    }
    function close(){ overlay.style.display='none'; overlay.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true'); }
    closeModal.addEventListener('click', close);
    overlay.addEventListener('click', (e)=>{ if(e.target===overlay) close(); });

    // Breathing exercise content
    function breathingContent(){
      return `
        <h3>Guided breathing</h3>
        <p class="lead">A short paced breath to settle the nervous system. Follow the circle.</p>
        <div class="breath-circle" id="breathCircle"><div class="breath-count" id="breathLabel">Ready</div></div>
        <div style="text-align:center" class="controls-row">
          <button class="btn" id="startBreath">Start 3 cycles</button>
          <button class="btn ghost" id="stopBreath">Stop</button>
        </div>
      `;
    }

    // Journal content
    function journalContent(){
      return `
        <h3>Timed journaling</h3>
        <p class="lead">Write for 3 minutes. Focus on one prompt, then close with a simple next step.</p>
        <div>
          <label for="prompt">Choose a prompt</label>
          <select id="prompt" style="width:100%;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:6px">
            <option>What matters most to me this week?</option>
            <option>What challenge feels most pressing right now?</option>
            <option>What would a small meaningful step look like today?</option>
          </select>
          <textarea id="journalText" placeholder="Start writing..." style="margin-top:8px"></textarea>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px;align-items:center">
            <button class="btn" id="startJournal">Start 3-min timer</button>
            <button class="btn ghost" id="saveJournal">Save</button>
            <div id="journalTimer" style="margin-left:auto;color:var(--muted)"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      `;
    }

    // Intention content
    function intentionContent(){
      return `
        <h3>Set an intention</h3>
        <p class="lead">A short intention helps center action. Choose one and name a micro-step you can do today.</p>
        <div>
          <label for="intentText">Intention</label>
          <input id="intentText" type="text" placeholder="e.g. Sleep earlier; take a 10-minute walk">
          <label for="intentStep" style="margin-top:8px;display:block">Today I will...</label>
          <input id="intentStep" type="text" placeholder="Small, concrete step">
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px">
            <button class="btn" id="saveIntent">Save intention</button>
            <button class="btn ghost" id="dismissIntent">Close</button>
          </div>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;font-size:13px">Saved intentions are kept in your browser for private reference.</p>
        </div>
      `;
    }

    // Wire open buttons
    document.getElementById('openBreath').addEventListener('click', ()=>{ openModal(breathingContent()); initBreathing(); });
    document.getElementById('openJournal').addEventListener('click', ()=>{ openModal(journalContent()); initJournal(); });
    document.getElementById('openIntent').addEventListener('click', ()=>{ openModal(intentionContent()); initIntent(); });
    tryNowBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{ openModal(breathingContent()); initBreathing(); });

    // Breathing logic
    let breathInterval=null; let breathPhase=0; let breathCycles=0; function initBreathing(){
      const circle = document.getElementById('breathCircle'); const label = document.getElementById('breathLabel');
      document.getElementById('startBreath').addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        clearInterval(breathInterval); breathPhase=0; breathCycles=0;
        const sequence = [ {label:'Inhale',ms:4000,scale:1.35},{label:'Hold',ms:3500,scale:1.1},{label:'Exhale',ms:6000,scale:0.8} ];
        let idx=0; let elapsed=0;
        label.textContent = 'Beginning';
        breathInterval = setInterval(()=>{
          const step = sequence[idx];
          // animate
          circle.animate([{transform:`scale(${step.scale})`}],{duration:step.ms,fill:'forwards'});
          label.textContent = step.label;
          elapsed += step.ms;
          idx = (idx+1)%sequence.length;
          if(step.label==='Exhale') breathCycles++;
          if(breathCycles>=3){ clearInterval(breathInterval); label.textContent='Done'; }
        }, 1000); // schedule next state transitions inside
        // We'll use a more accurate timing via recursive setTimeout to preserve steps
        clearInterval(breathInterval);
        idx=0; breathCycles=0;
        function runStep(){
          const s = sequence[idx];
          circle.style.transform = `scale(${s.scale})`;
          label.textContent = s.label;
          if(s.label==='Exhale') breathCycles++;
          setTimeout(()=>{ idx=(idx+1)%sequence.length; if(breathCycles>=3){ label.textContent='Finished'; } else runStep(); }, s.ms);
        }
        runStep();
      });
      document.getElementById('stopBreath').addEventListener('click', ()=>{ clearInterval(breathInterval); label.textContent='Stopped'; circle.style.transform='scale(1)'; });
    }

    // Journal logic
    function initJournal(){
      const startBtn = document.getElementById('startJournal');
      const saveBtn = document.getElementById('saveJournal');
      const timer = document.getElementById('journalTimer');
      const text = document.getElementById('journalText');
      let tId=null; let remaining=0;

      startBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        remaining = 180; // 3 minutes
        timer.textContent = formatTime(remaining);
        text.focus();
        tId = setInterval(()=>{ remaining--; timer.textContent = formatTime(remaining); if(remaining<=0){ clearInterval(tId); timer.textContent='Done'; alert('Time complete — you can save your entry.'); } }, 1000);
      });

      saveBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        const v = text.value.trim();
        if(!v){ alert('Write something first.'); return; }
        const logs = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('hm_journal')||'[]');
        logs.push({time:new Date().toISOString(),text:v});
        localStorage.setItem('hm_journal', JSON.stringify(logs));
        alert('Saved to your browser.');
      });

      function formatTime(s){ const m=Math.floor(s/60); const sec=s%60; return m+':'+String(sec).padStart(2,'0'); }
    }

    // Intention logic
    function initIntent(){
      const save = document.getElementById('saveIntent');
      const dismiss = document.getElementById('dismissIntent');
      save.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        const intent = document.getElementById('intentText').value.trim();
        const step = document.getElementById('intentStep').value.trim();
        if(!intent || !step){ alert('Please add an intention and a small step.'); return; }
        const list = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('hm_intents')||'[]');
        list.push({time:new Date().toISOString(),intent,step});
        localStorage.setItem('hm_intents', JSON.stringify(list));
        alert('Intention saved locally.');
      });
      dismiss.addEventListener('click', ()=>{ close(); });
    }

    // Small accessibility: close modal on esc
    window.addEventListener('keydown', (e)=>{ if(e.key==='Escape') close(); });

    // Set year
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"# Contact page — {{BUSINESS_NAME}} (holistic_medicine)

This bundle contains the contact page (contact.html) for the holistic/integrative medicine site. It is intended to be used as part of the site that includes index.html, services.html, conditions.html, approach.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html, contact.html.

Files in this chunk:
- contact.html — the contact page with interactive features and an embedded single-file UI (HTML, CSS, JS).

Placeholders to replace in deployment (do not remove from template):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Key features implemented locally (no external assets):
- Whole-person inventory: a checklist of domains that generates a suggested consultation agenda and a recommended follow-up cadence. The agenda is built from a small internal mapping of domain -> suggested talking points. The cadence is a heuristic depending on how many areas are selected. This is educational and labeled as such; it is not diagnostic.
- Try-it guided exercise modal (three short practices):
  - Breathing exercise: paced inhale/hold/exhale cycles with a visual circle that scales to suggest breath timing. A 3-cycle starter is provided.
  - Timed journaling: 3-minute timer with prompt selector and local save to browser storage.
  - Intention setting: quick intention + micro-step saved locally to browser storage.

Accessibility & behaviors:
- Modal is keyboard-closeable with Escape and clickable overlay to dismiss.
- Forms are client-side handled with friendly alerts for demonstration; the main contact form posts to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} when using the schedule link.

Developer notes:
- The file references an SVG pattern at assets/img/pattern.svg in the project theme, but no external resources are required for functionality. Ensure the pattern file is present in the final project assets folder for visual consistency.
- The contact form submit handler uses a local alert to emulate submission and then resets the form. Replace with real form handling / API integration as needed.
- Inventory suggestions and cadence heuristics are intentionally simple and educational; modify mappings in the contact.html script if you want different phrasing or deeper logic.

Usage:
- Drop contact.html into your site root alongside the other pages.
- Replace placeholders with the real business values.
- Optionally wire contact form to the clinic scheduling endpoint or CRM by editing the form action ({{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}) and the form submit handler.

Compliance:
- The page intentionally avoids medical claims and includes a short disclaimer stating this is educational and not a diagnosis.

If you need variants (e.g., localized language, altered cadence heuristics, or analytics hooks), request an update and specify desired behavior."}
BUNDLE_END
